window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>An AMAZON TOP 50 BESTSELLERA STANDALONE</p> <p>Irish Mafia MARRIAGE OF CONVENIENCE and AGE GAP Romance.</p> <p>Lethal Enforcer X Damaged Ballerina</p> <p>Cruel. Insane. Furious. Lachlan O’Rourke crashed my wedding, saw the bruises under my veil, and now… he’s my new husband.</p> <p>He’s untamed and reclusive and says I’m way too young and innocent for a monster like him. He keeps reminding me this is just a marriage of convenience to keep me safe until the ballet conservatory accepts me.</p> <p>Dancing is my life. Unaliving is his.</p> <p>Only, I’m falling for him, and you know what they say?</p> <p>The devil you know is better than the one you don’t.</p> <p>Or will this deal with the devil be both our downfall?</p>"; 
